  "content": "<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/fc16fab0570de1b441578bdf54830fbfe271da52c6c2e8fcc3f1c9bbd08a1657/68747470733a2f2f692e706f7374696d672e63632f4d47484a793932702f62616e6e65722e706e67\"></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfishs-gun-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cutt.ly/mmvX3jE\" width=\"192\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cutt.ly/jUoIaLT\" width=\"208\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/47c9FG7fdW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=blue&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;📖 關於</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Additional Guns 是 MrCrayfish 所創建的槍械模組擴充包。此模組新增了由社群創作的新槍械</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">隨著時間推移將會持續新增更多槍械以及新功能。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>1.16.x</strong> 版本需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obfuscate\" rel=\"nofollow\">Obfuscate</a> - <strong>1.18.x</strong> 版本<em>及以上</em>需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/framework\" rel=\"nofollow\">Framework</a></span></p><h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\">➕<strong> 想要更多內容？</strong></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果您對更多具備獨特附加功能的槍械感興趣，歡迎試用我們的其他模組 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/project-arsenal\" rel=\"nofollow\">Project Arsenal</a>！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>👦 社群</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">有興趣加入我們的社群或追蹤更新進度嗎？歡迎加入我們的&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/47c9FG7fdW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器。</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>📥 更新與版本</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組將會持續更新新內容，請務必保持關注最新版本！</span></p>",
